# Herald of Serra {2}{W}{W}, "Echo {2}{W}{W}" (CR 702.30a). Cast on turn 1 (paid with generic from Sol Ring's colorless mana and W mana), it came under Bot1's control since the beginning of their last upkeep, so at Bot1's turn 3 upkeep the echo ability
# triggers and asks for {2}{W}{W}. The colorless mana, a Mox Sapphire (U) and 1 of the two W sources are tapped first (as much mana as the cost, one W
